      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Routing Supplier Invoices Automatically"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A fictional finance team estimated the effect of automatic invoice routing."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "615fbf74-be8d-4b4f-86d9-ff00df5ad49c"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Results"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Estimated reduction of up to 30% in processing time; there was no deployment measurement."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "615fbf74-be8d-4b4f-86d9-ff00df5ad49c"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The estimate comes from a desk review of five sample invoices and no production data."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "9a06fa22-728c-412a-8fe8-86e88341a46d"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Conclusion"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Treat the 30% figure as an upper-bound estimate, not a measured result."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "615fbf74-be8d-4b4f-86d9-ff00df5ad49c"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "9a06fa22-728c-412a-8fe8-86e88341a46d"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
